OL,3,GNEWSAFinance chief latest to resign
OL,4,Afrom county council
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Council's chief operating and
OL,7,Ffinance officer has resigned after six
OL,8,Fmonths in the role due to personal
OL,9,Freasons, the authority's leader has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FAnnabel Scholes has become the third
OL,13,Fsenior member to leave the authority in
OL,14,FOctober following the resignations of
OL,15,Fchief executive officer Kate Kennally
OL,16,Fand service director for people
OL,17,Fcommissioning Rachael Rothero.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
