OL,3,GNEWSAFinance chief latest to resign
OL,4,Afrom county council
OL,5,
OL,6,FScholes took over the role in March,
OL,7,Ffollowing the departure of Alice Gunn,
OL,8,Fwho had been in the role for less than
OL,9,Fa year and also decided to leave due to
OL,10,Fpersonal reasons.
OL,12,FLeader Leigh Frost said he could not
OL,13,Fpretend the departures were not a
OL,14,Fproblem and "whilst it is a pretty
OL,15,Fhefty bump in the road, it is only a
OL,16,Fbump".
